roditeaddis.com\">Home</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"https://www.aphroditeaddis.com/services\">Services</a></li>\n<li class=\"nav-item dropdown active d-none\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<a href=\"#\" class=\"nav-link dropdown-toggle\" data-toggle=\"dropdown\">Company <i class=\"fa fa-angle-down\"></i></a>\n<ul class=\"dropdown-menu\" role=\"menu\">\n<li class=\"active\"><a href=\"https://www.aphroditeaddis.com/about\">About Us</a></li>\n<li style=\"display: none;\"><a href=\"https://www.aphroditeaddis.com/team\">Our Team</a></li>\n<li style=\"display: none;\"><a href=\"https://www.aphroditeaddis.com/testimonials\">Testimonials</a></li>\n<li style=\"display: none;\"><a href=\"https://www.aphroditeaddis.com/faq\">FAQ</a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"https://www.aphroditeaddis.com/blog\">Blog</a></li>\n<span class=\"d-none\">\n<li><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"https://www.aphroditeaddis.com/checkout\">Checkout</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"https://www.aphroditeaddis.com/shopping-cart\">Shopping Cart</a></li>\n</span>\n<li class=\"nav-item active\"><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"https://www.aphroditeaddis.com/about\">About Us</a></li>\n<li><a class=\"nav-link\" href=\"https://www.aphroditeaddis.com/contacts\">Contacts</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n</nav>\n</div>\n<!--/ Col end -->\n</div>\n<!--/ Row end -->\n</div>\n<!--/ Container end -->\n</div>\n<!--/ Navigation end -->\n</header>\n<!--/ Header end -->\n\n\n<form method=\"GET\" class=\"search\" id=\"bigger-search\" action=\"https://www.aphroditeaddis.com/services\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"category\" value=\"\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"in_stock\" value=\"\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"search_in_title\" value=\"\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"order_new\" value=\"\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"order_price\" value=\"\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"order_procurement\" value=\"\">\n<input type=\"hidden\" name=\"brand_id\" value=\"\">\n<span class=\"d-none\">\n<div class=\"hidden\">\n<div class=\"form-group\">\n<label for=\"quantity_more\">Quantity more than</label>\n<input type=\"text\" value=\"\" name=\"quantity_more\" id=\"quantity_more\" placeholder=\"Type number\" class=\"form-control\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n<div class=\"form-group\">\n<label for=\"added_after\">Added after</label>\n<div class=\"input-group date\">\n<input type=\"text\" value=\"\" name=\"added_after\" id=\"added_after\" class=\"form-control\"><span class=\"input-group-addon\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-th\"></i></span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n<div class=\"form-group\">\n<label for=\"added_before\">Added before</label>\n<div class=\"input-group date\">\n<input type=\"text\" value=\"\" name=\"added_before\" id=\"added_before\" class=\"form-control\"><span class=\"input-group-addon\"><i class=\"glyphicon glyphicon-th\"></i></span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"form-group\">\n<label for=\"search_in_body\">Search for word in the description</label>\n<input class=\"form-control\" value=\"\" name=\"search_in_body\" id=\"search_in_body\" type=\"text\">\n</div>\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n<div class=\"form-group\">\n<label for=\"price_from\">Price from</label>\n<input type=\"text\" value=\"\" name=\"price_from\" id=\"price_from\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Type number\">\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n<div class=\"form-group\">\n<label for=\"price_to\">Price to</label>\n<input type=\"text\" name=\"price_to\" value=\"\" id=\"price_to\" class=\"form-control\" placeholder=\"Type number\">\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<input type=\"text\" class=\"field\" id=\"search_in_title\" value=\"\" placeholder=\"Search here...\">\n<a href=\"javascript:void(0);\" onclick=\"submitForm()\"><i class=\"fa fa-search\"></i></a>\n</span>\n</form>\n<div id=\"banner-area\" class=\"banner-area\" style=\"background-image:url(https://www.aphroditeaddis.com/assets/imgs/banner1.jpg)\">\n<div class=\"banner-text\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-12\">\n<div class=\"banner-heading\">\n<h1 class=\"banner-title\">About Us</h1>\n</div>\n</div><!-- Col end -->\n</div><!-- Row end -->\n</div><!-- Container end -->\n</div><!-- Banner text end -->\n</div><!-- Banner area end --> \n<section id=\"main-container\" class=\"main-container\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-6\">\n<h3 class=\"column-title\">Who We Are</h3>\n<p>Aphrodite International Hotel is a suitably appointed four star hotel at the city center of Addis \nAbaba, Ethiopia, just ten minutes away from Addis Ababa Bole International Airport with convenient \nshuttle transportation available to get you to and from the hotel easily.\n</p>\n<p>Meeting international standards with exceptional levels of personalized service, it offers exclusive, \nluxury accommodation, luxurious restaurant, and bars for both corporate and leisure travelers as its \nmotto “Serving for Extraordinary Expectations” implies. </p>\n<p>Our rooms typify your very own away from home. Our superb and tranquil rooms accommodate a \ntotal of 64 guests and are suitable for both corporate and leisure travelers. The rooms spoil you with \ngenerous space, all equipped with state of the art facilities and contemporary comforts. The \nluxurious amenities with exquisite interior setting make guests to relax, work and sleep in elegance. \nRoom service is always a call away via the telephone on your desk.\n</p>\n\n<p>The Aphrodite conference hall which can accommodate 250 guests at a time can also \nbe divided into 3 individual halls along with spacious foyer area and roof top view of \nthe city. It is ideal for tailor-made corporate meetings, conferences, social events and \nweddings. It’s also equipped with high tech sound system, Free WIFI and TV \nconnection, AC system, LCD projector, Flip chart stand which maximize coziness and \nconvenience of our clients.</p>\n<p>The state-of-the-art facilities of the hotel include, specious lobby lounge and front \nlobby, mini-bar, spa/massage, gymnasium and health center. The staff is helpful and \nwill do their best to make your stay as pleasant as possible! Staying in Aphrodite \nInternational Hotel will make your visit to Addis Ababa extra special! \n</p>\n<p>Aphrodite International Hotel is a great starting point from which to explore Addis Ababa. \nSituated with earnest ambience at Guinea Conakry Street, a central point of the city, \nAphrodite is within walking distance to the United Nation Economic Commission for \nAfrica (UNECA) headquarter and United Nations Conference Center (UNCC), a walk of \nten minutes to the African Union headquarter, situated at a quiet location surrounded by \nthe city’s hot spots, major regional and governmental and international offices &amp; modern \nand traditional shopping centers. Aphrodite is a perfect choice as base for exploring \nAddis Ababa and attend conferences and meetings at UNECA’s UNCC and African Union!</p>\n\n<p>When you book rooms and suites directly through \n<a href=\"https://www.aphroditeaddis.com/contacts\">  https://www.aphroditeaddis.com/contacts</a>, you will be guaranteed the best prices. Book \ndirectly online or send us your request for information/ enquiry/ comment, etc.</p>\n\n</div><!-- Col end -->\n<div class=\"col-lg-6 mt-5 mt-lg-0\">\n<div id=\"page-slider\" class=\"page-slider small-bg slick-initialized slick-slider\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"carousel-control left slick-arrow\" aria-label=\"carousel-control\" style=\"\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-left\"></i></button>\n<div class=\"slick-list draggable\"><div class=\"slick-track\" style=\"opacity: 1; width: 1620px;\"><div class=\"item slick-slide slick-current slick-active\" style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://www.aphroditeaddis.com/assets/imgs/slider-pages/slide-page1.jpg&quot;); width: 540px; position: relative; left: 0px; top: 0px; z-index: 999; opacity: 1;\" data-slick-index=\"0\" aria-hidden=\"false\" tabindex=\"0\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"box-slider-content\">\n<div class=\"box-slider-text\">\n<h2 class=\"box-slide-title\">Leadership</h2>\n</div>    \n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"item slick-slide\" style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://www.aphroditeaddis.com/assets/imgs/slider-pages/slide-page1.jpg&quot;); width: 540px; position: relative; left: -540px; top: 0px; z-index: 998; opacity: 0;\" data-slick-index=\"1\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"box-slider-content\">\n<div class=\"box-slider-text\">\n<h2 class=\"box-slide-title\">Relationships</h2>\n</div>    \n</div>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"item slick-slide\" style=\"background-image: url(&quot;https://www.aphroditeaddis.com/assets/imgs/slider-pages/slide-page1.jpg&quot;); width: 540px; position: relative; left: -1080px; top: 0px; z-index: 998; opacity: 0;\" data-slick-index=\"2\" aria-hidden=\"true\" tabindex=\"-1\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"box-slider-content\">\n<div class=\"box-slider-text\">\n<h2 class=\"box-slide-title\">Performance</h2>\n</div>    \n</div>\n</div>\n</div></div></div><!-- Item 1 end -->\n<!-- Item 1 end -->\n<!-- Item 1 end -->\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"carousel-control right slick-arrow\" aria-label=\"carousel-control\" style=\"\"><i class=\"fas fa-chevron-right\"></i></button></div><!-- Page slider end-->          \n</div><!-- Col end -->\n</div><!-- Content row end -->\n</div><!-- Container end -->\n</section><!-- Main container end -->  <footer id=\"footer\" class=\"footer bg-overlay\">\n<div class=\"footer-main\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row justify-content-between\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 footer-widget footer-about\">\n<h3 class=\"widget-title\">About Us</h3>\nAphrodite International Hotel is a four star luxury hotel situated with in the heart of Addis, A walking distance from UNECA &amp; having 52 comfortable &amp; spacious Rooms, Conference &amp; meeting facilities, restaurant &amp; cafe, Grand &amp; Piano Bars.<div class=\"footer-social\">\n<ul>\n<li> <a target=\"_new\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/aphroditeaddis/\" aria-label=\"Facebook\"><i class=\" fab fa-facebook\"></i></a></li>\n<li> <a target=\"_new\" href=\"https://www.twitter.com/aphroditeaddis/\" aria-label=\"Twitter\"><i class=\"fab fa-twitter\"></i></a></li>\n                      \n</ul>\n</div><!-- Footer social end -->\n</div><!-- Col end -->\n<div class=\"col-lg-4 col-md-6 footer-widget mt-5 mt-md-0\">\n<h3 class=\"widget-title\">Working Hours</h3>\n<div class=\"working-hours\">\nWe work 7 days a week, every day including major holidays. Contact us if you have an emergency, with our\nHotline and Contact form.\n<br><br> Monday - Friday: <span class=\"text-right\">8:30 - 18:30 </span>\n<br> Saturday: <span class=\"text-right\">8:30 - 18:30</span>\n<br> Sunday: <span class=\"text-right\">8:30 - 18:30</span>\n</div>\n</div><!-- Col end -->\n<div class=\"col-lg-3 col-md-6 mt-5 mt-lg-0 footer-widget\">\n<h3 class=\"widget-title\">Services</h3>\n<ul class=\"list-arrow\">\n<li><a href=\"https://www.aphroditeaddis.com/\">Accommodation</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.aphroditeaddis.com/\">Bar &amp; Restaurant</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.aphroditeaddis.com/\">Fitness Center &amp; Spa</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.aphroditeaddis.com/\">Conference &amp; Events</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.aphroditeaddis.com/\">Things to Do in Addis Ababa</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><!-- Col end -->\n</div><!-- Row end -->\n</div><!-- Container end -->\n</div><!-- Footer main end -->\n<div class=\"copyright\">\n<div class=\"container\">\n<div class=\"row align-items-center\">\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">\n<div class=\"copyright-info\">\n<span>Copyright © Aphrodite International Hotel. Powered by Afro Procurement Solutions Plc</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"col-md-6\">